      "content": "reclaiming my self? i don't feel like i'm reclaiming anything, i feel like i'm being erased. it feels less like my voice is being \"amplified\" and more like a ghost version of me is being used to interact with my family so i don't have to. if this thing is actually picking up my private metaphors and ways of thinking, how do i even know if the messages i get from my brother are actually from him, or if it's just the model playing him like a puppet? is there any way to tell if someone is real or if it's just my digital shadow?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
